5FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Stitch origin indicators on the Artifacts Stitches sub-tab[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every row on the Artifacts Stitches sub-tab carries a distinct, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]self-documenting indicator for how the commit was created — through[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`sase stitch create`, automatically by another `sase` command, or [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]by hand — backed by a provenance invariant that makes the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]classification reliable rather than heuristic, and exposed through [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a matching `origin:` filter, the shared `sase stitch log` [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]renderers, and the core wire.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]stitch_origin_badges.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/stitch_origin_badges.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-jo[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-jo/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Core stitch-origin classifier[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add the `CommitOriginWire` enum, the footer-driven [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`classify_commit_origin` function, and the `origin` field on the VCS-log[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit wire in the linked `sase-core` repo, bump the VCS-log wire schema[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]version, and expose both through the PyO3 binding with Rust unit and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parity tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Tracked-commit provenance invariant[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]invariant[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]invariant: stamp `SASE_TYPE=stitch` on every commit created through the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tracked `sase stitch create` workflow, audit every remaining [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit-creating call site so each stamps a `SASE_TYPE=` value, and add a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract test that keeps new call sites from regressing the invariant.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python wire and golden-contract parity[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]wire[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire: mirror the new `origin` field in the Python VCS-log wire records, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]teach the pure-Python golden-contract parser to compute the same value, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and update the shared commit fixtures and core wire tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Timeline, legend, and detail rendering[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: add the shared origin glyph/label/style module, the fixed origin[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]column on timeline rows, the adaptive legend key, the Origin line in the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Stitches detail panel, and the origin field in every `sase stitch log` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output format, with unit and PNG visual coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]origin filter and CLI flag[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]filter[dim] · [dim][/dim]after wire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]filter: add the repeatable, negatable `origin:` key to the Stitches [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]filter query language with completions and canonical rendering, plus the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]matching `sase stitch log --origin` flag and post-collection filtering.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs, help modal, and configuration reference[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after invariant, render, filter[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: document the origin taxonomy, glyphs, provenance invariant, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`origin:` filter across the ACE guide, commit-workflow guide, CLI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference, configuration reference, and the ACE help modal.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-jo","hidden":false,"llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","phase_bead_id":"sase-jo.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-56baf9729980c4074b6a636664c745fb","started_at":"2026-08-11T07:03:25.617734","state":"dismissed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1786463171,"sha":"33b886150b672b85f471d0e3d1a9e9de0385cb71","subject":"fix(vcs): preserve SASE_TYPE footer across commit amend"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"0d13dcc9cf1f1eb377791aadb33f11015cc3a20ee84d29a7ab96531976f1b18b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jo.land--code/chat.md","size_bytes":14499},"commits":{"digest":"a895557fe8037667293d4becb6c2fd95fa08a0fa81416b9694f92091fb0005e4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jo.land--code/commits.json","size_bytes":233},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-jo.land--code/embedded_workflows.